{
  "_help": [
    "Where the tutorials place things in the lobby rooms. Each entry has a room (1-10, default 1) and a",
    "tile in it: x 0-7 from the west wall (left), y 0-7 from the south wall (bottom).",
    "rooms: each room's south-west tile in world coordinates. Rooms not listed are worked out from the",
    "game's own room objects; add one here to pin it exactly.",
    "orientation: 0 faces south, 512 west, 1024 north, 1536 east. In scenes, actors turn to face their target.",
    "scale (NPCs, optional): size in percent. labelHeight (optional): how high the label floats.",
    "attach (NPCs, optional): worn item models merged in, such as the shortbow (model 512) in the Attacker's hands.",
    "models: bare game models (trap, launcher, hopper, spring); loop: true plays their animation all the time.",
    "lift (models): raise by this much (128 = a tile); onFloor: true raises it until its bottom rests on the floor.",
    "Rooms: 1 team, 9 the Penance line-up, 10 the Queen. Basics: 2 Attacker, 3 Defender, 4 Healer,",
    "5 Collector, 6 egg launcher, 7 Healer spring, 8 Queen eggs.",
    "Edit and save: the scene reloads within a tick while the tutorial is running.",
    "Entries missing here are taken from the plugin's own copy, so delete one to get its default back."
  ],
